<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=9">
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>MKVToolNix Batch Remuxer v1.0.42</title>
<HTA:APPLICATION 
    ID="App" 
    BORDER="thin" 
    CAPTION="yes" 
    SHOWINTASKBAR="yes" 
    SINGLEINSTANCE="yes" 
    SYSMENU="yes" 
    SCROLL="no"/>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { width: 100%; height: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body {
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
    background: #eef2f7;
    color: #253247;
    padding: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.container {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #dce3ed;
    border-radius: 13px;
    padding: 15px;
    overflow: hidden;
}
h2 {
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 25px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #243b5a;
    text-align: center;
}
.red-text { color: #d63031; }
.row {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    clear: both;
}
.row label {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 0 4px 1px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #45556d;
}
.field-line {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 34px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 0;
}
.row input[type="text"] {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: top;
    width: 80%;
    height: 34px;
    padding: 7px 9px;
    margin: 0 1.5% 0 0;
    border: 1px solid #d5deea;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #f9fbfe;
    color: #26364d;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    outline: none;
}
.row input[type="text"]:focus {
    border-color: #6b9df7;
    background: #ffffff;
}
.btn-browse {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: top;
    width: 18%;
    height: 34px;
    padding: 0 8px;
    background: #3978e8;
    color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #3978e8;
    border-radius: 7px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
}
.btn-browse:hover { background: #2866d2; }
.name-line {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 34px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 0;
    margin-top: 4px;
}
.row input[type="text"].name-input {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: top;
    width: 80%;
    height: 34px;
    padding: 7px 9px;
    margin: 0 1.5% 0 0;
    border: 1px solid #d5deea;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #f9fbfe;
    color: #26364d;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    outline: none;
}
.row input[type="text"].name-input:focus {
    border-color: #6b9df7;
    background: #ffffff;
}
.name-label {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: top;
    width: 18%;
    height: 34px;
    line-height: 34px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #8895a7;
    font-weight: 400;
}
.checkbox-row {
    margin: 11px 0;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    min-height: 40px;
    background: #f5f8fc;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid #e1e8f1;
}
.checkbox-row label {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 18px;
    color: #40516a;
    cursor: pointer;
}
.checkbox-row input {
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin: 0 7px 0 0;
}
.buttons {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 42px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 0;
}
button.action {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: top;
    width: 49%;
    height: 42px;
    padding: 0 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: white;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-right: 2%;
}
button.action:last-child { margin-right: 0; }
.btn-check { background: #3978e8; }
.btn-check:hover { background: #2866d2; }
.btn-create { background: #279b63; }
.btn-create:hover { background: #208454; }
.btn-create:disabled {
    background: #aab4c2;
    cursor: not-allowed;
}
.secondary-buttons {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 40px;
    margin: 0 0 11px 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 0;
}
button.secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: top;
    width: 49%;
    height: 40px;
    padding: 0 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: white;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-right: 2%;
}
button.secondary:last-child { margin-right: 0; }
.btn-update { background: #f1c40f; color: #333; }
.btn-update:hover { background: #e0b100; }
.btn-update.checked { background: #279b63; color: #fff; }
.btn-update.checked:hover { background: #208454; }
.btn-update:disabled {
    background: #d4d4d4;
    color: #888;
    cursor: not-allowed;
}
.btn-run-cmd { background: #aab4c2; color: #fff; }
.btn-run-cmd:hover { background: #95a0ae; }
.btn-run-cmd.active { background: #279b63; }
.btn-run-cmd.active:hover { background: #208454; }
.btn-run-cmd:disabled {
    background: #aab4c2;
    cursor: not-allowed;
}
textarea {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 185px;
    padding: 10px 11px;
    border: 1px solid #d9e1eb;
    border-radius: 9px;
    resize: none;
    margin: 0 0 9px 0;
    background: #fbfcfe;
    color: #33445c;
    font-family: Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 16px;
    overflow: auto;
}
.status {
    min-height: 35px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 18px;
    display: none;
}
.status.info {
    background: #edf5ff;
    color: #285b9e;
    border: 1px solid #d7e8ff;
    display: block;
}
.status.success {
    background: #eaf7ef;
    color: #247044;
    border: 1px solid #d1eddb;
    display: block;
}
.status.error {
    background: #fff0f0;
    color: #a43b3b;
    border: 1px solid #f5d6d6;
    display: block;
}
</style>
<script language="VBScript">
Dim fso, shell, videoDict, audioDict, subDict, fullSubDict, fontDict, groupedFiles
Dim regKey, htaPath, logPath, outputFolder, APP_VERSION, cmdCreated
Const enableDetailedLog = True
Const UPDATE_CHECK_INTERVAL_DAYS = 7
APP_VERSION = "1.0.42"
cmdCreated = False

Sub InitLog()
    htaPath = document.location.pathname
    If Left(htaPath, 1) = "/" Then htaPath = Mid(htaPath, 2)
    htaPath = Replace(htaPath, "/", "\")
    htaPath = URLDecode(htaPath)
    logPath = fso.GetParentFolderName(htaPath) & "\mkv_remuxer_debug.log"
    Dim stream
    Set stream = CreateObject("ADODB.Stream")
    stream.Type = 2
    stream.Charset = "utf-8"
    stream.Open
    stream.WriteText "=== MKV Remuxer Debug Log ===" & vbCrLf
    stream.WriteText "Started: " & Now & vbCrLf
    stream.WriteText "HTA Path: " & htaPath & vbCrLf
    stream.WriteText "Version: " & APP_VERSION & vbCrLf & vbCrLf
    stream.SaveToFile logPath, 2
    stream.Close
    Log "=== NEW SESSION ==="
End Sub

Sub Log(msg)
    On Error Resume Next
    If logPath <> "" Then
        Dim stream, content, timestamp
        timestamp = "[" & Hour(Now) & ":" & Minute(Now) & ":" & Second(Now) & "]"
        Set stream = CreateObject("ADODB.Stream")
        stream.Type = 2
        stream.Charset = "utf-8"
        stream.Open
        If fso.FileExists(logPath) Then
            stream.LoadFromFile logPath
            content = stream.ReadText
            stream.Close
            stream.Open
        Else
            content = ""
        End If
        content = content & timestamp & " " & msg & vbCrLf
        stream.WriteText content
        stream.SaveToFile logPath, 2
        stream.Close
    End If
    On Error GoTo 0
End Sub

Function URLDecode(str)
    Dim i, result, ch
    result = ""
    For i = 1 To Len(str)
        ch = Mid(str, i, 1)
        If ch = "%" And i + 2 <= Len(str) Then
            result = result & Chr(CInt("&H" & Mid(str, i+1, 2)))
            i = i + 2
        Else
            result = result & ch
        End If
    Next
    URLDecode = result
End Function

Function GetGroupKey(baseName)
    Dim pos, key
    pos = InStr(baseName, "(")
    If pos > 0 Then
        key = Trim(Left(baseName, pos - 1))
    Else
        pos = InStr(baseName, ".")
        If pos > 0 Then
            key = Trim(Left(baseName, pos - 1))
        Else
            key = Trim(baseName)
        End If
    End If
    Do While InStr(key, "  ") > 0
        key = Replace(key, "  ", " ")
    Loop
    GetGroupKey = key
    If enableDetailedLog Then Log "GetGroupKey: '" & baseName & "' -> '" & key & "'"
End Function

Function GetAudioSuffix(groupKey, audioBaseName)
    Dim suffix
    If Len(audioBaseName) > Len(groupKey) Then
        suffix = Mid(audioBaseName, Len(groupKey) + 1)
        Do While Left(suffix, 1) = "." Or Left(suffix, 1) = " "
            suffix = Mid(suffix, 2)
        Loop
        GetAudioSuffix = suffix
    Else
        GetAudioSuffix = ""
    End If
End Function

Sub AssignEvents()
    On Error Resume Next
    document.getElementById("btnVideo").onclick = GetRef("BrowseVideo")
    document.getElementById("btnAudio").onclick = GetRef("BrowseAudio")
    document.getElementById("btnSub").onclick = GetRef("BrowseSub")
    document.getElementById("btnFullSub").onclick = GetRef("BrowseFullSub")
    document.getElementById("btnFont").onclick = GetRef("BrowseFont")
    document.getElementById("btnOutput").onclick = GetRef("BrowseOutput")
    document.getElementById("btnMkv").onclick = GetRef("BrowseMkv")
    document.getElementById("btnCheck").onclick = GetRef("CheckFiles")
    document.getElementById("btnCreate").onclick = GetRef("CreateCMD")
    document.getElementById("btnUpdate").onclick = GetRef("CheckUpdates")
    document.getElementById("btnRunCmd").onclick = GetRef("RunCMD")
    document.getElementById("videoFolder").onblur = GetRef("SaveSession")
    document.getElementById("audioFolder").onblur = GetRef("SaveSession")
    document.getElementById("subFolder").onblur = GetRef("SaveSession")
    document.getElementById("fullSubFolder").onblur = GetRef("SaveSession")
    document.getElementById("fullSubName").onblur = GetRef("SaveSession")
    document.getElementById("fontFolder").onblur = GetRef("SaveSession")
    document.getElementById("outputFolder").onblur = GetRef("SaveSession")
    document.getElementById("mkvmergePath").onblur = GetRef("SaveSession")
    On Error GoTo 0
End Sub

Sub Window_OnLoad
    On Error Resume Next
    Set fso = CreateObject("Scripting.FileSystemObject")
    Set shell = CreateObject("WScript.Shell")
    
    window.resizeTo 780, 1045
    
    Dim screenWidth, screenHeight
    screenWidth = document.parentWindow.screen.availWidth
    screenHeight = document.parentWindow.screen.availHeight
    window.moveTo (screenWidth - 780) / 2, (screenHeight - 1045) / 2
    
    Set videoDict = CreateObject("Scripting.Dictionary")
    Set audioDict = CreateObject("Scripting.Dictionary")
    Set subDict = CreateObject("Scripting.Dictionary")
    Set fullSubDict = CreateObject("Scripting.Dictionary")
    Set fontDict = CreateObject("Scripting.Dictionary")
    Set groupedFiles = CreateObject("Scripting.Dictionary")
    
    regKey = "HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\MKVToolNixBatchRemuxer"
    
    InitLog
    Log "Window_OnLoad started"
    
    LoadSession
    AssignEvents
    
    cmdCreated = False
    
    ' Проверяем, нужно ли автоматически проверить обновления
    CheckAutoUpdate
    
    Log "Window_OnLoad completed"
    ShowStatus "Выберите папки и нажмите 'Проверить'", "info"
    On Error GoTo 0
End Sub

' === АВТОМАТИЧЕСКАЯ ПРОВЕРКА ОБНОВЛЕНИЙ ПРИ ЗАПУСКЕ ===
Sub CheckAutoUpdate()
    Dim lastCheck, currentTime, daysSinceCheck
    On Error Resume Next
    lastCheck = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\LastUpdateCheck")
    On Error GoTo 0
    
    If IsNumeric(lastCheck) And lastCheck <> "" Then
        currentTime = DateDiff("s", "01/01/1970 00:00:00", Now())
        daysSinceCheck = (currentTime - CLng(lastCheck)) / 86400
        
        Log "Last update check: " & lastCheck & " (" & Int(daysSinceCheck) & " days ago)"
        
        If daysSinceCheck < UPDATE_CHECK_INTERVAL_DAYS Then
            ' Неделю ещё не прошло — показываем последний результат
            Dim lastResult
            On Error Resume Next
            lastResult = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\LastUpdateResult")
            On Error GoTo 0
            
            If lastResult <> "" Then
                document.getElementById("resultArea").value = lastResult
                ' Кнопка зелёная — проверка уже была
                document.getElementById("btnUpdate").className = "secondary btn-update checked"
                document.getElementById("btnUpdate").innerHTML = "Проверено (актуально)"
                Log "Using cached update result"
            End If
            Exit Sub
        End If
    Else
        Log "No previous update check recorded"
    End If
    
    ' Прошло больше недели (или первая проверка) — запускаем проверку
    Log "Auto-checking for updates (interval expired)"
    window.setTimeout "CheckUpdates", 500, "VBScript"
End Sub

Sub RunCMD()
    If Not cmdCreated Then
        ShowStatus "Сначала создайте CMD!", "error"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    
    Dim outFolder, cmdPath
    outFolder = document.getElementById("outputFolder").value
    cmdPath = outFolder & "\remux.cmd"
    
    If Not fso.FileExists(cmdPath) Then
        ShowStatus "Файл remux.cmd не найден в папке вывода!", "error"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    
    Log "RunCMD: запускаем " & cmdPath
    shell.Run "cmd.exe /c """ & cmdPath & """", 1, False
    ShowStatus "CMD запущен!", "success"
End Sub

Sub CheckUpdates()
    Log "=== CheckUpdates STARTED ==="
    document.getElementById("btnUpdate").disabled = True
    document.getElementById("btnUpdate").innerHTML = "Проверка..."
    
    Dim resultText
    resultText = "Проверка обновлений..." & vbCrLf & vbCrLf
    
    Dim currentVersion
    currentVersion = APP_VERSION
    resultText = resultText & "Текущая версия: v" & currentVersion & vbCrLf
    
    Dim http, json, latestVersion, latestFile
    Set http = CreateObject("WinHttp.WinHttpRequest.5.1")
    
    On Error Resume Next
    http.setTimeouts 5000, 5000, 5000, 10000
    http.Open "GET", "https://api.github.com/repos/asuka93sama/MKVToolNix-Batch-Remuxer/contents/", False
    http.SetRequestHeader "User-Agent", "MKVToolNix-Batch-Remuxer"
    http.SetRequestHeader "Accept", "application/vnd.github.v3+json"
    http.Send
    
    If Err.Number <> 0 Then
        resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "[ОШИБКА] Не удалось подключиться к GitHub:" & vbCrLf & Err.Description
        document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
        ShowStatus "Ошибка сети", "error"
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").disabled = False
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").innerHTML = "Проверить обновления"
        Err.Clear
        On Error GoTo 0
        Exit Sub
    End If
    On Error GoTo 0
    
    If http.Status <> 200 Then
        resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "[ОШИБКА] GitHub вернул код: " & http.Status
        document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
        ShowStatus "Ошибка GitHub", "error"
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").disabled = False
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").innerHTML = "Проверить обновления"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    
    json = http.ResponseText
    
    Dim regex, matches, match
    Set regex = New RegExp
    regex.Pattern = "MKVToolNix Batch Remuxer v([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)\.hta"
    regex.Global = True
    regex.IgnoreCase = True
    
    Set matches = regex.Execute(json)
    
    latestVersion = "0.0.0"
    latestFile = ""
    
    For Each match In matches
        Dim ver
        ver = match.SubMatches(0)
        If CompareVersions(ver, latestVersion) > 0 Then
            latestVersion = ver
            latestFile = "MKVToolNix Batch Remuxer v" & ver & ".hta"
        End If
    Next
    
    If latestVersion = "0.0.0" Then
        resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "[ОШИБКА] Не удалось найти версию на GitHub"
        document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
        ShowStatus "Ошибка parsing", "error"
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").disabled = False
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").innerHTML = "Проверить обновления"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    
    resultText = resultText & "Последняя версия: v" & latestVersion & vbCrLf
    
    ' Сохраняем время проверки и результат в реестр
    Dim currentTime
    currentTime = DateDiff("s", "01/01/1970 00:00:00", Now())
    On Error Resume Next
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\LastUpdateCheck", currentTime, "REG_SZ"
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\LastUpdateResult", resultText, "REG_SZ"
    On Error GoTo 0
    Log "Saved update check time to registry: " & currentTime
    
    If CompareVersions(latestVersion, currentVersion) <= 0 Then
        resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "[OK] У вас установлена последняя версия!"
        document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
        ShowStatus "Обновлений нет", "success"
        ' Кнопка становится зелёной
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").disabled = False
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").className = "secondary btn-update checked"
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").innerHTML = "Проверено (актуально)"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    
    resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "Доступно обновление: v" & currentVersion & " -> v" & latestVersion
    resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & vbCrLf & "Начинаю загрузку..."
    document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
    
    Dim tempDir, downloadPath, extractPath
    tempDir = shell.ExpandEnvironmentStrings("%TEMP%") & "\MKVRemuxer_Update"
    downloadPath = tempDir & "\update.zip"
    extractPath = tempDir & "\extract"
    
    On Error Resume Next
    If fso.FolderExists(tempDir) Then fso.DeleteFolder tempDir, True
    fso.CreateFolder tempDir
    On Error GoTo 0
    
    resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "Скачивание..."
    document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
    
    Dim psCmd
    psCmd = "powershell -NoProfile -Command ""$ProgressPreference = 'SilentlyContinue'; [Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol = [Net.SecurityProtocolType]::Tls12; Invoke-WebRequest -Uri 'https://github.com/asuka93sama/MKVToolNix-Batch-Remuxer/archive/refs/heads/main.zip' -OutFile '" & Replace(downloadPath, "\", "\\") & "'"""
    
    shell.Run psCmd, 0, True
    
    If Not fso.FileExists(downloadPath) Then
        resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "[ОШИБКА] Не удалось скачать архив"
        document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
        ShowStatus "Ошибка загрузки", "error"
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").disabled = False
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").innerHTML = "Проверить обновления"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    
    resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "Распаковка..."
    document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
    
    psCmd = "powershell -NoProfile -Command ""Expand-Archive -Path '" & Replace(downloadPath, "\", "\\") & "' -DestinationPath '" & Replace(extractPath, "\", "\\") & "' -Force"""
    shell.Run psCmd, 0, True
    
    Dim extractedFolder, newHtaPath
    extractedFolder = ""
    For Each folder In fso.GetFolder(extractPath).SubFolders
        extractedFolder = folder.Path
        Exit For
    Next
    
    If extractedFolder = "" Then
        resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "[ОШИБКА] Не найдена распакованная папка"
        document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
        ShowStatus "Ошибка распаковки", "error"
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").disabled = False
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").innerHTML = "Проверить обновления"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    
    newHtaPath = extractedFolder & "\" & latestFile
    If Not fso.FileExists(newHtaPath) Then
        resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "[ОШИБКА] Не найден файл: " & latestFile
        document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
        ShowStatus "Файл не найден", "error"
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").disabled = False
        document.getElementById("btnUpdate").innerHTML = "Проверить обновления"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    
    resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "Создание резервной копии..."
    document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
    
    Dim backupFolder, currentHta
    backupFolder = htaPath & "\..\backup"
    If Not fso.FolderExists(backupFolder) Then fso.CreateFolder backupFolder
    
    currentHta = fso.GetFileName(htaPath)
    On Error Resume Next
    fso.CopyFile htaPath, backupFolder & "\" & currentHta, True
    On Error GoTo 0
    
    resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "Установка новой версии..."
    document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
    
    fso.CopyFile newHtaPath, htaPath & "\..\", True
    
    Dim folder, file
    For Each file In fso.GetFolder(htaPath & "\..").Files
        If LCase(fso.GetExtensionName(file.Name)) = "hta" Then
            If LCase(file.Name) <> LCase(latestFile) Then
                On Error Resume Next
                file.Delete
                On Error GoTo 0
            End If
        End If
    Next
    
    On Error Resume Next
    fso.DeleteFolder tempDir, True
    On Error GoTo 0
    
    resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & vbCrLf & "[OK] Обновление успешно установлено!"
    resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & "v" & currentVersion & " -> v" & latestVersion
    resultText = resultText & vbCrLf & vbCrLf & "Перезапуск программы..."
    document.getElementById("resultArea").value = resultText
    
    ShowStatus "Обновление успешно!", "success"
    
    Log "Update completed: " & currentVersion & " -> " & latestVersion
    window.setTimeout "RestartApp", 1500, "VBScript"
End Sub

Sub RestartApp()
    shell.Run """" & htaPath & "\..\" & fso.GetFileName(htaPath) & """", 1, False
    window.Close
End Sub

Function CompareVersions(v1, v2)
    Dim a1, a2, i, n1, n2
    a1 = Split(v1, ".")
    a2 = Split(v2, ".")
    
    For i = 0 To 2
        n1 = 0 : n2 = 0
        If i <= UBound(a1) Then n1 = CLng(a1(i))
        If i <= UBound(a2) Then n2 = CLng(a2(i))
        
        If n1 > n2 Then
            CompareVersions = 1
            Exit Function
        ElseIf n1 < n2 Then
            CompareVersions = -1
            Exit Function
        End If
    Next
    CompareVersions = 0
End Function

Sub BrowseVideo()
    BrowseFolder "videoFolder"
End Sub
Sub BrowseAudio()
    BrowseFolder "audioFolder"
End Sub
Sub BrowseSub()
    BrowseFolder "subFolder"
End Sub
Sub BrowseFullSub()
    BrowseFolder "fullSubFolder"
End Sub
Sub BrowseFont()
    BrowseFolder "fontFolder"
End Sub
Sub BrowseOutput()
    BrowseFolder "outputFolder"
End Sub
Sub BrowseMkv()
    BrowseFile "mkvmergePath"
End Sub

Sub SaveSession
    On Error Resume Next
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\VideoFolder", document.getElementById("videoFolder").value, "REG_SZ"
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\AudioFolder", document.getElementById("audioFolder").value, "REG_SZ"
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\SubFolder", document.getElementById("subFolder").value, "REG_SZ"
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\FullSubFolder", document.getElementById("fullSubFolder").value, "REG_SZ"
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\FullSubName", document.getElementById("fullSubName").value, "REG_SZ"
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\OutputFolder", document.getElementById("outputFolder").value, "REG_SZ"
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\MkvPath", document.getElementById("mkvmergePath").value, "REG_SZ"
    shell.RegWrite regKey & "\FontFolder", document.getElementById("fontFolder").value, "REG_SZ"
    On Error GoTo 0
End Sub

Sub LoadSession
    On Error Resume Next
    Dim val
    val = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\VideoFolder")
    If Err.Number = 0 Then document.getElementById("videoFolder").value = val
    Err.Clear
    val = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\AudioFolder")
    If Err.Number = 0 Then document.getElementById("audioFolder").value = val
    Err.Clear
    val = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\SubFolder")
    If Err.Number = 0 Then document.getElementById("subFolder").value = val
    Err.Clear
    val = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\FullSubFolder")
    If Err.Number = 0 Then document.getElementById("fullSubFolder").value = val
    Err.Clear
    val = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\FullSubName")
    If Err.Number = 0 Then document.getElementById("fullSubName").value = val
    Err.Clear
    val = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\OutputFolder")
    If Err.Number = 0 Then document.getElementById("outputFolder").value = val
    Err.Clear
    val = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\MkvPath")
    If Err.Number = 0 Then 
        document.getElementById("mkvmergePath").value = val
    Else
        document.getElementById("mkvmergePath").value = "C:\Program Files\MKVToolNix\mkvmerge.exe"
    End If
    Err.Clear
    val = shell.RegRead(regKey & "\FontFolder")
    If Err.Number = 0 Then document.getElementById("fontFolder").value = val
    Err.Clear
    On Error GoTo 0
End Sub

Sub BrowseFolder(inputId)
    Dim shellApp, folder
    Set shellApp = CreateObject("Shell.Application")
    Set folder = shellApp.BrowseForFolder(0, "Выберите папку", 0)
    If Not folder Is Nothing Then
        document.getElementById(inputId).value = folder.Self.Path
        SaveSession
    End If
End Sub

Sub BrowseFile(inputId)
    Dim cmd, tempFile, stream, result
    tempFile = fso.GetSpecialFolder(2) & "\file_dialog.txt"
    cmd = "mshta ""javascript:var input=document.createElement('input');input.type='file';input.click();new ActiveXObject('Scripting.FileSystemObject').OpenTextFile('" & Replace(tempFile, "\", "\\") & "',2,true).Write(input.value);close();"""
    shell.Run cmd, 0, True
    If fso.FileExists(tempFile) Then
        Set stream = CreateObject("ADODB.Stream")
        stream.Type = 2
        stream.Charset = "utf-8"
        stream.Open
        stream.LoadFromFile tempFile
        result = Trim(stream.ReadText)
        stream.Close
        fso.DeleteFile tempFile
        If result <> "" Then 
            document.getElementById(inputId).value = result
            SaveSession
        End If
    End If
End Sub

Function GetFilesDict(folderPath, extensions)
    Dim dict, f, ext, baseName, key, fileCount
    Set dict = CreateObject("Scripting.Dictionary")
    fileCount = 0
    If folderPath = "" Then 
        Set GetFilesDict = dict
        Exit Function
    End If
    If Not fso.FolderExists(folderPath) Then 
        Set GetFilesDict = dict
        Exit Function
    End If
    For Each f In fso.GetFolder(folderPath).Files
        ext = LCase(fso.GetExtensionName(f.Name))
        If InStr(extensions, ext) > 0 Then
            baseName = fso.GetBaseName(f.Name)
            key = GetGroupKey(baseName)
            If Not dict.Exists(key) Then
                dict.Add key, f.Path
                fileCount = fileCount + 1
                If enableDetailedLog Then Log "  Added: " & baseName & " -> " & key
            End If
        End If
    Next
    If enableDetailedLog Then Log "Total files found: " & fileCount
    Set GetFilesDict = dict
End Function

Function GetFontsList(folderPath)
    Dim fonts, f, ext, fontList, fontCount
    fontList = ""
    fontCount = 0
    If folderPath = "" Or Not fso.FolderExists(folderPath) Then 
        GetFontsList = ""
        Exit Function
    End If
    Set fonts = CreateObject("Scripting.Dictionary")
    For Each f In fso.GetFolder(folderPath).Files
        ext = LCase(fso.GetExtensionName(f.Name))
        If InStr("ttf,otf,woff,woff2", ext) > 0 Then
            If Not fonts.Exists(f.Path) Then
                fonts.Add f.Path, True
                fontCount = fontCount + 1
                If fontList <> "" Then fontList = fontList & "|"
                fontList = fontList & f.Path
            End If
        End If
    Next
    GetFontsList = fontList
End Function

Sub CheckFiles
    Dim vPath, aPath, sPath, fsPath, fPath, outPath
    vPath = document.getElementById("videoFolder").value
    aPath = document.getElementById("audioFolder").value
    sPath = document.getElementById("subFolder").value
    fsPath = document.getElementById("fullSubFolder").value
    fPath = document.getElementById("fontFolder").value
    outPath = document.getElementById("outputFolder").value
    outputFolder = outPath
    Dim mkvPath
    mkvPath = document.getElementById("mkvmergePath").value
    If vPath = "" Or aPath = "" Or outPath = "" Or mkvPath = "" Then
        ShowStatus "Ошибка: Заполните обязательные поля (видео, аудио, вывод, mkvmerge)!", "error"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    If Not fso.FolderExists(outPath) Then
        Dim answer
        answer = MsgBox("Папка вывода не существует:" & vbCrLf & vbCrLf & outPath & vbCrLf & vbCrLf & "Создать её?", 4 + 32, "Папка не найдена")
        If answer = 6 Then
            On Error Resume Next
            fso.CreateFolder outPath
            If Err.Number <> 0 Then
                ShowStatus "Ошибка создания папки: " & Err.Description, "error"
                Err.Clear
                On Error GoTo 0
                Exit Sub
            End If
            On Error GoTo 0
            ShowStatus "Папка создана: " & outPath, "info"
        Else
            ShowStatus "Укажите существующую папку вывода", "error"
            Exit Sub
        End If
    End If
    cmdCreated = False
    document.getElementById("btnRunCmd").disabled = True
    document.getElementById("btnRunCmd").className = "secondary btn-run-cmd"
    ShowStatus "Сканирование...", "info"
    window.setTimeout "DoCheck", 50, "VBScript"
End Sub

Sub DoCheck
    Dim vExt, aExt, sExt, fontList
    vExt = "mkv,mp4,avi,mov,ts,m2ts"
    aExt = "m4a,mp3,flac,wav,ac3,dts,aac,ogg,mka"
    sExt = "srt,ass,ssa,sub"
    Set videoDict = GetFilesDict(document.getElementById("videoFolder").value, vExt)
    Set audioDict = GetFilesDict(document.getElementById("audioFolder").value, aExt)
    Set subDict = GetFilesDict(document.getElementById("subFolder").value, sExt)
    Set fullSubDict = GetFilesDict(document.getElementById("fullSubFolder").value, sExt)
    fontList = GetFontsList(document.getElementById("fontFolder").value)
    Set groupedFiles = CreateObject("Scripting.Dictionary")
    Dim key, resultText, count, fontInfo
    resultText = ""
    count = 0
    If fontList <> "" Then
        fontInfo = "Шрифты: " & (UBound(Split(fontList, "|")) + 1) & " файлов" & vbCrLf & vbCrLf
    Else
        fontInfo = "Шрифты не добавлены (не обязательно)" & vbCrLf & vbCrLf
    End If
    For Each key In videoDict.Keys
        If audioDict.Exists(key) Then
            Dim hasSub, hasFullSub, subInfo
            Dim audioPath, audioBaseName, audioSuffix
            Dim videoBaseName
            hasSub = subDict.Exists(key)
            hasFullSub = fullSubDict.Exists(key)
            audioPath = audioDict(key)
            audioBaseName = fso.GetBaseName(audioPath)
            audioSuffix = GetAudioSuffix(key, audioBaseName)
            videoBaseName = fso.GetBaseName(videoDict(key))
            groupedFiles.Add key, Array(videoDict(key), videoBaseName, audioPath, audioSuffix, IIf(hasSub, subDict(key), ""), IIf(hasFullSub, fullSubDict(key), ""), fontList)
            subInfo = ""
            If hasSub And hasFullSub Then
                subInfo = "С: надписи + полные" & vbCrLf
            ElseIf hasSub Then
                subInfo = "С: надписи" & vbCrLf
            ElseIf hasFullSub Then
                subInfo = "С: полные" & vbCrLf
            Else
                subInfo = "С: нет (опционально)" & vbCrLf
            End If
            Dim audioInfo
            If audioSuffix <> "" Then
                audioInfo = "   А: " & audioPath & " [" & audioSuffix & "]" & vbCrLf
            Else
                audioInfo = "   А: " & audioPath & vbCrLf
            End If
            resultText = resultText & "[OK] " & key & vbCrLf
            resultText = resultText & "   В: " & videoDict(key) & vbCrLf
            resultText = resultText & audioInfo
            resultText = resultText & subInfo
            If fontList <> "" Then resultText = resultText & "   F: " & fontList & vbCrLf
            resultText = resultText & vbCrLf
            count = count + 1
        Else
            resultText = resultText & "[!] " & key & " (нет аудио — пропущено)" & vbCrLf & vbCrLf
        End If
    Next
    document.getElementById("resultArea").value = fontInfo & resultText
    If count = 0 Then
        ShowStatus "Группы не найдены! Проверьте, что имена файлов совпадают.", "error"
        document.getElementById("btnCreate").disabled = True
    Else
        ShowStatus "Найдено: " & count & ". Можно создавать CMD.", "success"
        document.getElementById("btnCreate").disabled = False
    End If
End Sub

Function IIf(condition, truePart, falsePart)
    If condition Then
        IIf = truePart
    Else
        IIf = falsePart
    End If
End Function

Sub CreateCMD
    If groupedFiles.Count = 0 Then
        ShowStatus "Сначала проверьте!", "error"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    Dim outFolder, mkvPath
    outFolder = document.getElementById("outputFolder").value
    mkvPath = document.getElementById("mkvmergePath").value
    If Not fso.FileExists(mkvPath) Then
        ShowStatus "mkvmerge не найден!", "error"
        Exit Sub
    End If
    ShowStatus "Генерация...", "info"
    window.setTimeout "DoCreateCMD", 50, "VBScript"
End Sub

Sub DoCreateCMD
    Dim outFolder, mkvPath, keepAudio, cmdContent, key, paths
    Dim vPath, videoBaseName, aPath, audioSuffix, sPath, fsPath, fontList, outPath, mkvCmd
    Dim fontArr, i, fullSubName, audioTrackName
    outFolder = document.getElementById("outputFolder").value
    mkvPath = document.getElementById("mkvmergePath").value
    keepAudio = document.getElementById("chkKeepAudio").checked
    fullSubName = Trim(document.getElementById("fullSubName").value)
    If fullSubName = "" Then
        fullSubName = "Rus"
    End If
    cmdContent = "@echo off" & vbCrLf
    cmdContent = cmdContent & "chcp 65001 >nul" & vbCrLf & vbCrLf
    cmdContent = cmdContent & "set MKVMERGE=""" & mkvPath & """" & vbCrLf & vbCrLf
    For Each key In groupedFiles.Keys
        paths = groupedFiles(key)
        vPath = paths(0)
        videoBaseName = paths(1)
        aPath = paths(2)
        audioSuffix = paths(3)
        sPath = paths(4)
        fsPath = paths(5)
        fontList = paths(6)
        outPath = outFolder & "\" & videoBaseName & ".mkv"
        If keepAudio Then
            mkvCmd = "%MKVMERGE% -o """ & outPath & """ """ & vPath & """ "
        Else
            mkvCmd = "%MKVMERGE% -o """ & outPath & """ --no-audio --no-subtitles """ & vPath & """ "
        End If
        If audioSuffix <> "" Then
            audioTrackName = "Rus " & audioSuffix
        Else
            audioTrackName = "Rus"
        End If
        mkvCmd = mkvCmd & "--default-track 0:yes --track-name 0:""" & audioTrackName & """ """ & aPath & """ "
        If sPath <> "" And fsPath <> "" Then
            mkvCmd = mkvCmd & "--default-track 0:yes --track-name 0:""Надписи"" """ & sPath & """ "
            mkvCmd = mkvCmd & "--default-track 0:no --track-name 0:""" & fullSubName & """ """ & fsPath & """ "
        ElseIf sPath <> "" Then
            mkvCmd = mkvCmd & "--default-track 0:yes --track-name 0:""Надписи"" """ & sPath & """ "
        ElseIf fsPath <> "" Then
            mkvCmd = mkvCmd & "--default-track 0:yes --track-name 0:""" & fullSubName & """ """ & fsPath & """ "
        End If
        If fontList <> "" Then
            fontArr = Split(fontList, "|")
            For i = 0 To UBound(fontArr)
                mkvCmd = mkvCmd & "--attachment-mime-type application/x-truetype-font --attachment-name """ & fso.GetFileName(fontArr(i)) & """ --attach-file """ & fontArr(i) & """ "
            Next
        End If
        cmdContent = cmdContent & "echo Processing: " & videoBaseName & vbCrLf
        cmdContent = cmdContent & mkvCmd & vbCrLf
        cmdContent = cmdContent & "echo." & vbCrLf
    Next
    cmdContent = cmdContent & "echo Done!" & vbCrLf
    cmdContent = cmdContent & "pause"
    SaveFileUTF8 outFolder & "\remux.cmd", cmdContent
    
    cmdCreated = True
    document.getElementById("btnRunCmd").disabled = False
    document.getElementById("btnRunCmd").className = "secondary btn-run-cmd active"
    
    ShowStatus "Готово! CMD создан. Можно запускать.", "success"
End Sub

Sub SaveFileUTF8(filePath, content)
    Dim stream
    Set stream = CreateObject("ADODB.Stream")
    stream.Type = 2
    stream.Charset = "utf-8"
    stream.Open
    stream.WriteText content
    stream.SaveToFile filePath, 2
    stream.Close
    Set stream = Nothing
End Sub

Sub ShowStatus(text, cssClass)
    Dim statusDiv
    Set statusDiv = document.getElementById("statusDiv")
    statusDiv.className = "status " & cssClass
    statusDiv.innerText = text
End Sub

window.setTimeout "Window_OnLoad", 100, "VBScript"
</script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <h2>MKVToolNix Batch Remuxer <span class="red-text">Asuka93sama</span></h2>
    <div class="row"><label>Папка с видео *</label><div class="field-line"><input type="text" id="videoFolder"><button class="btn-browse" id="btnVideo">Обзор</button></div></div>
    <div class="row"><label>Папка с аудио *</label><div class="field-line"><input type="text" id="audioFolder"><button class="btn-browse" id="btnAudio">Обзор</button></div></div>
    <div class="row"><label>Папка с субтитрами (надписи)</label><div class="field-line"><input type="text" id="subFolder"><button class="btn-browse" id="btnSub">Обзор</button></div></div>
    <div class="row"><label>Папка с субтитрами (полные)</label><div class="field-line"><input type="text" id="fullSubFolder"><button class="btn-browse" id="btnFullSub">Обзор</button></div></div>
    <div class="row"><label>Имя дорожки полных субтитров (пусто = "Rus")</label><div class="name-line"><input type="text" id="fullSubName" class="name-input" placeholder="Rus"><span class="name-label">Название дорожки</span></div></div>
    <div class="row"><label>Папка со шрифтами</label><div class="field-line"><input type="text" id="fontFolder"><button class="btn-browse" id="btnFont">Обзор</button></div></div>
    <div class="row"><label>Папка вывода *</label><div class="field-line"><input type="text" id="outputFolder"><button class="btn-browse" id="btnOutput">Обзор</button></div></div>
    <div class="row"><label>Путь к mkvmerge *</label><div class="field-line"><input type="text" id="mkvmergePath"><button class="btn-browse" id="btnMkv">Обзор</button></div></div>
    <div class="checkbox-row"><label><input type="checkbox" id="chkKeepAudio">Оставить аудио из видео (снять флаг "по умолчанию")</label></div>
    <div class="buttons">
        <button class="action btn-check" id="btnCheck">Проверить файлы</button>
        <button class="action btn-create" id="btnCreate" disabled>Создать CMD</button>
    </div>
    <div class="secondary-buttons">
        <button class="secondary btn-update" id="btnUpdate">Проверить обновления</button>
        <button class="secondary btn-run-cmd" id="btnRunCmd" disabled>Запустить CMD</button>
    </div>
    <textarea id="resultArea" readonly placeholder="Результат проверки..."></textarea>
    <div id="statusDiv" class="status"></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>